From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lamosquita <developer@lamosquita.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:54:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [local] Give the fake farbled plugins two MIME types (error
 11)

DOMPluginArray::GetFixedMimeTypeArray() in 156 takes item(0) and item(1)
of the first plugin. After shuffling, a fake plugin with a single MIME
type can come first; item(1) is then null and the renderer crashes with
SIGSEGV in DOMMimeTypeArray::NamedPropertyEnumerator (seen on Google
sign-in pages as "error 11"). Upstream Brave gives both fake plugins two
MIME types; do the same.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../blink/renderer/modules/plugins/dom_plugin_array.cc        | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chromium_src/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/plugins/dom_plugin_array.cc b/chromium_src/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/plugins/dom_plugin_array.cc
index 28b71717..d04d2c8a 100644
--- a/chromium_src/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/plugins/dom_plugin_array.cc
+++ b/chromium_src/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/plugins/dom_plugin_array.cc
@@ -121,7 +121,7 @@ void FarblePlugins(blink::LocalDOMWindow* window,
               "PLUGIN_1_FILENAME", 16),
           BraveSessionCache::From(*window).GenerateRandomString(
               "PLUGIN_1_DESCRIPTION", 32),
-          std::vector<const char*>{""},
+          std::vector<const char*>{"", ""},
           BraveSessionCache::From(*window).GenerateRandomString(
               "MIME_1_DESCRIPTION", 32),
           BraveSessionCache::From(*window)
@@ -137,7 +137,7 @@ void FarblePlugins(blink::LocalDOMWindow* window,
               "PLUGIN_2_FILENAME", 15),
           BraveSessionCache::From(*window).GenerateRandomString(
               "PLUGIN_2_DESCRIPTION", 31),
-          std::vector<const char*>{""},
+          std::vector<const char*>{"", ""},
           BraveSessionCache::From(*window).GenerateRandomString(
               "MIME_2_DESCRIPTION", 32),
           BraveSessionCache::From(*window)
-- 
2.43.0

